<title>UK: London gold fixes just easier, palladium firmer.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes just easier, palladium firmer.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $326.40 vs $326.55 previously. Fairly quiet but steady having eased slightly overnight. Seen stuck in $324-$328 range.</p>
<p>SILVER - Also quiet at $4.34/$4.36, up four cents.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Steady at $424.50/$427.50 down 50 cents.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - About $4.00 firmer at $206.00/$209.00. Up on investor short covering on Tocom, fund buying.</p>
</text>
